<div class="panel"><div class="panel-h">Capacity guide</div><div class="panel-b small"><ul style="padding-left:1.1em;margin:0"><li><strong>Interactive room:</strong> no server; up to ~25 viewers and 6 on camera.</li><li><strong>Broadcast, 100 viewers:</strong> a VPS with 4 vCPU, 8 GB RAM and a 1 Gbps network port. At 720p (~2 Mbps) 100 viewers need about 200 Mbps outbound.</li><li><strong>Social restream:</strong> uses about one CPU core per live session for encoding.</li><li>The host keeps the room tab open in the foreground on a wired or strong Wi-Fi connection (≥ 8 Mbps upload).</li></ul></div></div>
